# Everything here is LF, on every platform.
#
# Fourteen files had drifted to CRLF, and at least one of them for a reason
# worth writing down: tools/genimports.py writes src/imports.inc through a
# shell redirect, and Python's text-mode stdout on Windows translates every
# newline it is given.  The generators now ask for LF explicitly; this is the
# belt to that braces, so neither a checkout nor an editor nor a commit can put
# it back.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Except what is not text.  git's own detection would get these right, but a
# mangled PNG is a bad way to find out it was wrong.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
